  "description": "MediCore is a full‑stack Hospital Management System built with **Next.js (App Router)**. It supports multi‑role workflows (Patient / Doctor / Receptionist / Lab / Pharmacy / Admin) with **appointments + token-based queueing**, **analytics & reporting**, optional **payments/notifications**, and **account security (2FA)**. It also includes an **Emergency SOS** flow to prioritize urgent patients in the queue.",
